            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+orthogonal+group"} special orthogonal group
            allows a division by 2 when pulled back one step along the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead+tower"} Whitehead tower
            to the classifying space of the
            = succeed "," do
