            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dual+heterotic+string+theory"} magnetic dual
            Green-Schwarz mechanism can be seen to encode a twisted differential fivebrane structure and this is not practical to be studied without some higher geometry.
          %p The following restates this in a bit more technical detail.
          %p
            For
