          %h2#Examples Examples
          %h3#principal_1bundles_with_connection Principal 1-bundles with connection
          %p
            We spell out here how the general theory of
            %a{:href => "#InfinityLieAlgebraConnection"} ∞-Lie algebra valued connection
            reduces to the standard notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connection+on+a+bundle"} connections
