              %a{:href => "#InfinityLieAlgebraConnection"} genuine ∞-Lie algebra connections
              for
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝔤
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{g}
              an ordinary
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebra"} Lie algebra
              is weakly equivalent to the simplicial presheaf
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
