          %p We have seen that a refinement of the Chern-Weil homomorphism is available. The above morphism extends to a morphism
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
