                    %mi G
                    %mi diff
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \nabla, \nabla' : C(\{U_i\}) \to \mathbf{B}G_{diff}
            are two genuine connections with coinciding curvature characteristic classes
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
